(F5 T2 V5b: global_node_dof_empty (manual Professional 6.552), default -yes.
 Two quad4; element 2 is group 1 (group_type 1 -empty), so nodes 3 and 6
 are only connected to an empty element; their node_dof input is
 1.1 .. 2.9 (19 dofs: velx vely disx disy 6 eptxx.. 6 sigxx.. kap work temp).
 Expected node_dof 3 and 6 (scripts/build_safe.sh): every dof zero except the
 displacement, which keeps its value 1.3 1.4. Source: Professional
 02-08-2026 probe f5/v5b c2_def (same input). The manual says that all the
 dofs are set to zero: the displacement is an open owner decision
 (GLOBAL-NODE-DOF-EMPTY-DISPLACEMENT).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_strain_total
materi_stress
materi_plasti_kappa
materi_work
condif_temperature
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 2 0
node 4 0 1
node 5 1 1
node 6 2 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 4 5
element 2 -quad4 2 3 5 6
element_group 2 1
node_dof 3 1.1 1.2 1.3 1.4 1.5 1.6 1.7 1.8 1.9 2.0 2.1 2.2 2.3 2.4 2.5 2.6 2.7 2.8 2.9
node_dof 6 1.1 1.2 1.3 1.4 1.5 1.6 1.7 1.8 1.9 2.0 2.1 2.2 2.3 2.4 2.5 2.6 2.7 2.8 2.9
group_type 0 -materi -condif
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.3
group_condif_density 0 1.
